<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SYDNEY INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the Sydney</p>
<p>International tennis tournament on Monday (prefix denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, first round</p>
<p>Sarah Pitkowski (France) beat Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Kimberly Po (U.S.) beat Judith Wiesner (Austria) 6-2 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Rene Simpson (Canada) beat 6-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) 6-4</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany) 6-0 6-1</p>
<p>Naoko Sawamatsu (Japan) beat Meilen Tu (U.S.) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Sandra Dopfer (Austria) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Men's singles, first round</p>
<p>1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany)</p>
<p>6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>3-Albert Costa (Spain) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Slava Dosedel (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-3 6-7 (5-7) 6-3</p>
<p>Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Grant Doyle (Australia) 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
